  "name": "deeptutor",
  "description": "Use when evaluating or comparing a professor as a potential graduate advisor, including requests such as \"调查导师\", \"选导师\", \"导师怎么样\", \"这个导师 push 吗\", \"investigate this advisor\", \"should I join this lab\", or a professor name plus institution with evaluation intent. DeepTutor investigates publications, co-author networks, student trajectories, funding, lab culture, and exploitation/toxicity risk; applies region-specific searches for mainland China and international institutions; and renders a cited standalone HTML report in Chinese or English. Student outcomes are the highest-priority signal.",
